  "description": "The libxml2 library is a development toolbox providing the implementation of various XML standards.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * libxml2: mingw-libxml2: libxml2: Denial of Service via crafted XML input due to use-after-free (CVE-2026-6653)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * libxml2: CVE-2025-9714 fix (AlmaLinux-119279) backported wrong upstream commit ? dyn:map recursion still crashes (JIRA:AlmaLinux-249282)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
